Scm2Cpp - third-party components and their provenance
=====================================================

This file records which parts of Scm2Cpp derive from work by other authors,
and to what extent. The measurements are line-level comparisons against the
original sources, counting only non-comment, non-blank lines.

Schlep (Aubrey Jaffer)
----------------------

Original: http://people.csail.mit.edu/jaffer/Schlep/scm2c
A copy of the original scm2c.scm is preserved in the Git repository of the
SourceForge project scm2cpp (https://git.code.sf.net/p/scm2cpp/code).

