Citing this software
--------------------

The MIT License imposes no obligation to cite. If you use Scm2Cpp in academic
work, however, the author would appreciate a citation. Machine-readable
metadata is in CITATION.cff; the relevant publications are:

    H. Niitsuma. Scheme to C++ Simple Translator: Scm2Cpp.
    International Lisp Conference, 2012.

    H. Niitsuma. Scm2Cpp11: Translation from Scheme to readable C++11.
    IPSJ SIG Technical Report, 2013.
